{"seq":1,"slug":"climate-science","title":"气候科学基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/climate-change-basics/climate-science","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"earth-energy-balance","title":"地球能量收支","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/climate-change-basics/climate-science/earth-energy-balance","wordCount":2542,"readingTime":11},{"seq":2,"slug":"carbon-cycle","title":"碳循环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/climate-change-basics/climate-science/carbon-cycle","wordCount":2639,"readingTime":11},{"seq":3,"slug":"climate-system-feedbacks","title":"气候系统反馈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/climate-change-basics/climate-science/climate-system-feedbacks","wordCount":3366,"readingTime":14}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"气候科学基础\">气候科学基础</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>本章从物理学视角建立对气候系统的基础认知。地球气候由太阳辐射输入、大气-海洋-陆地的能量分配与再辐射共同决定。理解能量收支平衡、碳循环以及气候反馈机制，是把握气候变化本质的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章文档\">本章文档</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>序号</th>\n<th>文档</th>\n<th>核心内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>地球能量收支</td>\n<td>太阳辐射、反照率、温室效应物理机制、辐射强迫</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>碳循环</td>\n<td>碳源与碳汇、海洋碳泵、化石燃料扰动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>气候系统反馈</td>\n<td>正/负反馈、临界点、气候敏感度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"关键概念\">关键概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>辐射强迫（Radiative Forcing）</strong>：外部因素对地球能量平衡的净影响量</li>\n<li><strong>碳循环（Carbon Cycle）</strong>：碳在大气、海洋、陆地生物圈之间的流转</li>\n<li><strong>气候敏感度（ECS）</strong>：CO₂ 浓度加倍后的平衡态全球平均温升</li>\n</ul>\n"}